1
00:00:09,184 --> 00:00:12,912
Hi, I’m Anne. What’s your name?

2
00:00:13,296 --> 00:00:16,944
Hello! I’m Tom. It’s my first day here.

3
00:00:17,248 --> 00:00:21,408
It’s nice to meet you, Tom! Is everything OK?

4
00:00:21,696 --> 00:00:26,464
Well, I can’t find my pencil box. I think it’s in my locker.

5
00:00:26,768 --> 00:00:29,200
Here, I can lend you my pen.

6
00:00:29,584 --> 00:00:32,320
Thanks! Would you like a sweet?

7
00:00:32,448 --> 00:00:36,048
No, thank you. We can’t eat snacks in class.

8
00:00:36,496 --> 00:00:37,728
Can we drink water?

9
00:00:38,112 --> 00:00:40,112
Yes, of course.

10
00:00:40,384 --> 00:00:45,856
OK, thanks ... Oh! I’m sorry, I have to answer my phone.

11
00:00:46,144 --> 00:00:50,384
Oh, but we mustn’t bring our mobile phones to class. 

12
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:54,352
We have to turn them off and keep them in our lockers. 

13
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:58,752
That’s another rule. OK! Thanks for telling me, Anne.

14
00:00:59,152 --> 00:01:00,896
You’re welcome, Tom

